      "Introduction to Cloud Computing and AWS Advantages of Cloud Computing",
      "Introduction to ChatGPT",
      "SaaS, IaaS & PaaS",
      "Why we should care about AWS",
      "Computer networks, Infrastructure of the company",
      "IP addresses"
    ]
  },
  {
